# Lockfiles are authoritative: a MODULE.bazel or Cargo.toml change that the
# committed MODULE.bazel.lock does not record fails instead of silently
# re-resolving (and, for crate_universe, rewriting Cargo.lock). After a
# dependency change run `bazel mod deps --lockfile_mode=update` and commit the
# lockfiles; for the nested BCR test module do the same in examples/rust_to_rocq.
common --lockfile_mode=error
